  27:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc **** /*
  28:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * The circular buffer custom operator is used to implement strided streaming
  29:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * convolutions on TFLite Micro.  Each time this operator is invoked, it checks
ARM GAS  C:\Users\Chetan\AppData\Local\Temp\ccpHt89s.s 			page 2


  30:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * whether or not to run, based on a predetermined stride in time.  If the op
  31:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * runs, it inserts the input into the end of the output buffer and shifts the
  32:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * output values towards the start of the buffer.  It discards the oldest value
  33:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * in the output buffer.
  34:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  *
  35:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * Input: [<input N+1]
  36:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * Before shifting:
  37:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * Output: [<input 1>, <input 2>, <input ...>, <input N>]
  38:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  *
  39:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * After shifting:
  40:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * Output: [<input 2>, <input 3>, <input ...>, <input N+1>]
  41:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  *
  42:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * We make some assumptions in this custom operator:
  43:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * - Input shape must be [1, 1, 1, depth]
  44:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * - Output shape must be [1, num_slots, 1, depth]
  45:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * - Input and output types must match.
  46:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  * - Input and output quantization params must be identical.
  47:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc ****  */
  48:lib/tflite-micro/tensorflow/lite/micro/kernels/circular_buffer.cc **** namespace tflite {
